## 8. Commit Messages

Format: `type(scope): description`

| Type | Usage |
|------|-------|
| `feat` | New feature or capability |
| `fix` | Bug fix |
| `refactor` | Code restructuring without behavior change |
| `test` | Adding or updating tests |
| `chore` | Build, dependency, or tooling changes |
| `docs` | Documentation only |

Examples:
- `feat(orchestra): implement task 6 - Migrate sprint/handover review prompts`
- `fix: add missing SprintSettingsPanel import`
- `refactor(core): extract verification logic into separate module`
- `test(db): add coverage for migration edge cases`

